00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:11.200
Cornhole it!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.200
How many more you got?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.734
-100.
-Really?

00:05:18.734 --> 00:05:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:22.000
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.601
Thank you, roller coasters,

00:05:24.601 --> 00:05:26.167
